      |            ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
```

This example is an attempt at reducing the actually-desired:

```cpp
auto x = line | std::views::split(',') | std::views::transform(std::views::split('-'));
```

Which fails on the ambiguous `write` call.

